{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pulls/700","id":4886193452,"node_id":"PR_kwDODOyR6c8AAAABIz1lLA","html_url":"https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pull/700","diff_url":"https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pull/700.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pull/700.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/issues/700","number":700,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(debian): skip CVE-2026-111142 for zziplib with \"undetermined\" as fixed version","user":{"login":"DmitriyLewen","id":91113035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTEzMDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91113035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen","html_url":"https://github.com/DmitriyLewen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\n\nThe DB build fails in Debian ([run](https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/actions/runs/38859594790)):\n\n```\nversion comparison error: version error: upstream_version must start with digit\n  package_name: zziplib\n  vuln_id:      CVE-2026-111142\n  code_name:    trixie\n  code_ver:     0.13.78+dfsg.1-0.1\n  sid_ver:      undetermined\n```\n\nThe cause is a typo in `data/CVE/list` in the Debian security tracker: CVE-2026-111142 has `- zziplib undetermined` without angle brackets.\nThe line was added in commit [417e238c](https://salsa.debian.org/security-tracker-team/security-tracker/-/commit/417e238c1edb), where the neighbouring entries (e.g. CVE-2026-111141 for the same zziplib) correctly use `<undetermined>`.\n\nWithout the brackets, the tracker format treats the value as a fixed version.\nDebian itself parses it this way (`lib/python/sectracker/parsers.py`), and so does vuln-list-update; the [CVE-2026-111142](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-111142) page shows `undetermined` in the Fixed Version column.\ntrivy-db then compares this \"version\" with the package version in the release, `debver` fails to parse it, and the build stops.\n\nThis PR adds a narrow workaround for this entry only: CVE-2026-111142, package `zziplib`, version `undetermined` is treated as `<undetermined>`, i.e. skipped like the other entries from the same commit.\nAll other entries are parsed as before.\n\nThe fix in the Debian data has been requested separately.\nThe workaround is marked with a `TODO` and should be removed once the tracker line is fixed.\n\n## Testing\n\n- The \"happy path\" case in `TestVulnSrc_Update`, extended with an entry with the same typo, failed without the fix with the same error (`upstream_version must start with digit`) and passed with it. That test is not included in this PR because the workaround is temporary.\n- Existing `pkg/vulnsrc/debian` tests pass.\n","created_at":"2026-10-16T09:18:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:29:31Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e82302d346aa5634a52f20940862bbea5ad18287","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pulls/700/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pulls/700/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/issues/700/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/statuses/214dcba6855c92025bdb6b421118c5b307e369ef","head":{"label":"DmitriyLewen:fix/debian-undetermined-typo","ref":"fix/debian-undetermined-typo","sha":"214dcba6855c92025bdb6b421118c5b307e369ef","user":{"login":"DmitriyLewen","id":91113035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTEzMDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91113035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen","html_url":"https://github.com/DmitriyLewen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":427251865,"node_id":"R_kgDOGXdYmQ","name":"trivy-db","full_name":"DmitriyLewen/trivy-db","private":false,"owner":{"login":"DmitriyLewen","id":91113035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMTEzMDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91113035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen","html_url":"https://github.com/DmitriyLewen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriyLewen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.co